<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Sivendra | Portfolio</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --card-bg: #1e293b;
      --text-main: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --accent-glow: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .badge-container {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .badge {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    section {
      background-color: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent);
      display: inline-block;
      padding-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }

    p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    ul {
      list-style-type: none;
    }

    li {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    li::before {
      content: "▹";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--bg);
      padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Sivendra</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">College Student • Developer • Creator</p>
    <div class="badge-container">
      <span class="badge">English & Tamil</span>
      <span class="badge">Vibe Coding</span>
      <span class="badge">Fast Typing</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>
      I am a motivated college student with a passionate focus on computer literacy, modern development workflows, and digital content creation. I blend technical fundamentals with speed, efficiency, and creative problem-solving.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="skills">
    <h2>Skills & Capabilities</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Vibe Coding & Rapid Prototyping:</strong> Building and testing applications fast using AI-assisted development tools.</li>
      <li><strong>High-Speed English Typing:</strong> Precise and efficient text execution, documentation, and data entry.</li>
      <li><strong>Computer Operations:</strong> Software management, troubleshooting, and digital workflow tools.</li>
      <li><strong>Bilingual Communication:</strong> Fluent in English and Tamil.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2>Connect</h2>
    <p>Feel free to reach out for collaborations, projects, or networking.</p>
    <div class="links">
      <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" class="btn">LinkedIn Profile</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Sivendra. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
